"What the research examines"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The paper studies code translation, hypothesis search, and a reflection-based agent. It presents a programming approach for experimenting with search, not a specification of Asari’s complete commercial system."}],["$","a",null,{"className":"insight-read","href":"https://arxiv.org/html/2512.03571v1","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Source ",["$","$Ld",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:3:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":14}]]}]]}],["$","section","Where human design remains essential",{"children":["$Lf","$L10","$L11"]}],"$L12"],"$L13","$L14"]}]]}],"$L15"]}],"$L16"]}]
